      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Paired audio adapter training\nSet the source and target folders. Match filenames and align durations. Use .song.txt sidecars to keep excerpts from the same song in one split.\n\nSelect a source file in Load Audio. Example audio is not bundled.\n\nChoose an output name, then Run to prepare, train, preview and infer. For saved inference choose action=use_saved.\n\nResume with resume.pt and unchanged configuration/seeds. See docs/AUDIO_ADAPTERS.md."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Paired audio-to-audio test\nSource: original 8-second excerpts.\nTarget: aligned low-pass filtered audio.\n6 training songs / 2 held-out songs.\n\nTrainer: **use_saved**, step 40. Run to process Load Audio with the saved adapter.\n\nPlay Source, Target, Baseline and S40; scrub with the seek bar.\n\nFor your own pairs, set the folders, choose a new output name, and switch action to train. Keep both seeds fixed when resuming.\n\nExisting AR nodes above are muted."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
